    {
      "bank": "msg_0219",
      "index": 6,
      "text": "Sorry to keep you waiting!\\rWelcome to the BLOCK, youngblood!\\rMy name is Professor Oak.\\rBut everybody round here calls me\\nthe OG.\\rBefore you step outside, I gotta\\ntell you how things work\\fon these streets!\\r"
    },
    {
      "bank": "msg_0219",
      "index": 34,
      "text": "This world is full of crews...\\nand every crew is packin'.\\r"
    },
    {
      "bank": "msg_0219",
      "index": 35,
      "text": "We roll with our homies, and our\\nhomies roll with heat.\\rSometimes we kick it together.\\nSometimes we beef with other blocks.\\rSome folks roll up on other crews\\njust to see who got the\\fbiggest strap.\\r"
    },
    {
      "bank": "msg_0219",
      "index": 36,
      "text": "Now, who exactly is you?\\r"
    },
    {
      "bank": "msg_0219",
      "index": 43,
      "text": "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\\nYou ready?\\rYour come-up story is\\nabout to start.\\rCorner boys, opps, Block Bosses...\\nthey all waitin' on you!\\rGet your bread! Build your gang!\\nGo run Johto!\\rStay outta trouble. ...Or don't.\\r"
    },
    {
      "bank": "msg_0543_T20R0101",
      "index": 0,
      "text": "Professor Elm: Ayy, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\\nI been waitin' on you!\\rYou know what I do in this lab?\\rAs you know, everybody keeps their\\nhomies on speed dial in a Burner.\\rBut back in the day, people just\\nwalked around WITH their crew.\\fJust like your friend Lyra does!\\rBurners are great 'cause you can\\ncarry a whole gang in your pocket.\\rBut rollin' deep on foot gotta\\nhave some advantages.\\rStreet cred. Intimidation.\\nThe vibes, man.\\rSo I'm finna put you on with\\nyour first homie!\\rWalk the block with 'em. Let the\\nneighborhood see y'all. Maybe you\\fand your homie get closer\\fthan anybody thought.\\rThem Burners over there got some\\nhomies to roll with. They all\\fcome strapped, too...\\r"
    },
    {
      "bank": "msg_0543_T20R0101",
